        "approval_date": "2018-06-07",
        "description": {
          "text": "Added new indication for IV Mircera for anemia associated with CKD in pediatric patients 5-17 years on hemodialysis converting from another ESA",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for a new indication for Mircera administered by intravenous route for the treatment of anemia associated with chronic kidney disease (CKD) in pediatric patients 5 to 17 years of age on hemodialysis who are converting from another erythropoiesis-stimulating agent (ESA) after their hemoglobin level was stabilized with an ESA.",
              "doc_id": "d51cfe34-84b7-55e7-abd1-abc953e50c94",
