        "description": {
          "text": "Added subcutaneous once-monthly administration for correction of anemia in non-dialysis chronic kidney disease patients",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics license application provides for the \"Dosage and Administration\" of the prescribing information to indicate that methoxy polyethylene glycol-epoetin beta can be administered by subcutaneous injection once a month for the correction of anemia in chronic kidney disease patients who are not on dialysis.",
